            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><hr />\n<h2 id=\"wrapping-up\">Wrapping up</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">The auditing engine is complete. Six functions: find any field by ID two different ways, rank the harvest with a recursive sort, flag the polluted land, project production, and name the computational cost of each approach \u2014 all in code that stays fast as the survey grows.</span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">That last point is the real deliverable. Anyone can write a loop that works on 5,654 records. Writing code whose cost you can <em>predict and defend</em> as the data heads toward a million records is what separates a script from an engine \u2014 and it is the third asset in your Maji Ndogo portfolio.</span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Make sure every function runs without errors and matches the expected outputs before submitting.</span></span>"
          }
        }
